{
  "id": "DOC-19-T75758",
  "title": "Text: DET Greg Garno ↔ Anthony Fenech",
  "date": "2019-02-12",
  "from": "DET Greg Garno",
  "to": "Anthony Fenech",
  "type": "text",
  "subjects": [],
  "content": [
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "10:34 AM",
      "text": "“Tigers PR is really cracking down on the Fake News Media this year. You can’t stop walking behind pitchers throwing bullpen sessions, I’m told.”"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "10:35 AM",
      "text": "It’s too early for this"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "10:35 AM",
      "text": "Did someone send that to you or are you about to hit send?"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "10:35 AM",
      "text": "I’m not gonna tweet it"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "10:36 AM",
      "text": "Not worth it"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "10:36 AM",
      "text": "That’s a stupid rule to suddenly enforce"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "10:36 AM",
      "text": "Very"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:24 AM",
      "text": "Your old cat looked just like my old cat"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "11:26 AM",
      "text": "Which one?"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:26 AM",
      "text": "Gray one"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "11:26 AM",
      "text": "Short hair or long hair?"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:26 AM",
      "text": "Long"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "11:27 AM",
      "text": "Does yours also get clumps in the fur sometimes because it sticks together?"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:27 AM",
      "text": "Yeah, Nats"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:27 AM",
      "text": "Mats"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "11:27 AM",
      "text": "We had to shave ours once because they were too much to cut off"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:27 AM",
      "text": "[Attachment: Image]"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:28 AM",
      "text": "She just got shaved in December"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:28 AM",
      "text": "You gotta keep brushing them"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "11:28 AM",
      "text": "I know, it takes a lot of work."
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "11:28 AM",
      "text": "What prompted this by the way?"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:28 AM",
      "text": "Creeping on your IG"
    }
  ]
}